{
  "_comment": "Octail curated egg (plan §6.4). Based on minecraft java/paper/egg-paper.yaml (pelican-eggs, MIT licence). Octail has its own install script (the Folia egg's): the jar's SHA-256 from PaperMC's Fill API is checked, latest is the newest version with a stable build, a version or build that does not exist fails the install instead of installing another one, the User-Agent goes with every request, and no server.properties is downloaded from GitHub. Octail adds the paper tag, Minecraft Java idle sleep, install sandbox defaults and resource hints.",
